{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123611","id":4570301971,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABEGlGEw","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123611","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123611.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123611.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123611","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123611/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123611/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123611/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/6cfdb1fd3d3df3b8fb8effdd9af548281c44dd21","number":123611,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Fix errors caused by merging `Rect2i` without area in `RichRextLabel`","user":{"login":"TheJackiMonster","id":13867397,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODY3Mzk3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13867397?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheJackiMonster","html_url":"https://github.com/TheJackiMonster","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheJackiMonster/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheJackiMonster/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheJackiMonster/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheJackiMonster/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheJackiMonster/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheJackiMonster/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheJackiMonster/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheJackiMonster/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheJackiMonster/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/development/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nI haven't seen an exact issue regarding this problem but in one of my games, I got errors stating regularly:\r\n```\r\nE 0:00:17:413   merge: Rect2i size is negative, this is not supported. Use Rect2i.abs() to get a Rect2i with a positive size.\r\n  <C++ Source>  ./core/math/rect2i.h:111 @ merge()\r\n```\r\n\r\nBut they didn't cause my game to not function properly (at least in debug mode). So I focused on other things. However now I run into the issue that `[shy]` tags in BBCode wouldn't function in my release exports and I thought those errors might be related. So I checked the source code of RichTextLabel and figured my quick fix here would help. It actually gets rid of all the error messages I saw previously.\r\n\r\nIt would be nice to see this merged and I don't think it should cause any regressions for others. The only thing my change does: It protects the RichTextLabel from merging Rect2i with negative or zero sizes.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nI'm not sure yet whether it fixes my issue with `[shy]` tags in release exports. If not, I will likely look into this further since it kind of breaks text formatting in my game.\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nProvide additional information and explanation of your PR, including areas that you are uncertain of or require special attention from reviewers. For examples, please read our pull request guidelines: https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/development/contribution_rules.html#explain-your-contributions\r\n-->\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id